// MT-5 refusal reducer: `return` inside a `scope { }` block would exit the
// function past the block's join — refused at parse time (early-exit
// support is a named residue). break/continue/goto crossings share the
// mechanism (Program::in_scope_block / scope_block_bars_break).
int main()
{
    scope {
	return 0;
    }
}
